          "amp": "018952389940777752352740022662035698556754212983057533305827668963000000"
        },
        {
          "who": "B",
          "text": "Yes, I went early in the morning. I bought some hilsa fish and vegetables.",
          "bn": "হ্যাঁ, ভোরে গিয়েছিলাম। কিছু ইলিশ মাছ আর সবজি কিনেছিলাম।",
          "file": "lines/s03_2.mp3",
