        {
          "who": "A",
          "text": "I had rice with hilsa curry. My mother made a very tasty curry.",
          "bn": "আমি ভাত আর ইলিশের ঝোল খেয়েছিলাম। আমার মা দারুণ একটা ঝোল রেঁধেছিলেন।",
          "file": "lines/s03_5.mp3",
          "frames": 146,
          "amp": "099864445523434987755433320685001248983224950124566576553100000000000058897677656329944655548632000034445799630434554330076202357656665431000000"
